WEBVTT

00:08:27.711 --> 00:08:31.215
for the first time in a year,
she's done every step in that routine

00:08:31.257 --> 00:08:32.633
for two weeks straight.

00:08:33.759 --> 00:08:36.053
She says that now
that her teeth are clean,

00:08:36.095 --> 00:08:39.014
she's a little less stressed
about tomorrow's problems.

00:08:41.058 --> 00:08:43.185
And this approach can work
with any care task

00:08:43.185 --> 00:08:44.436
that you struggle with.

00:08:44.478 --> 00:08:45.646
Simply ask yourself,

00:08:45.688 --> 00:08:47.064
"What am I trying to achieve

00:08:47.064 --> 00:08:49.567
and how can I achieve it in my way?"

00:08:51.819 --> 00:08:54.989
In a rare moment of folding clothes ...

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.324
(Laughter)

00:08:57.366 --> 00:09:00.035
I looked down at the baby onesie
that I was folding,